{"content":"{\n  \"chapter_contract_id\": \"contract:v2-n-9-1:v2\",\n  \"node_id\": \"v2_n_9_1\",\n  \"known_evidence_ids\": [\n    \"evidence:source:35c41703812eb679e8c8b4c503690ae5b1ecc7b95d2643163a96ae1c016d27d2\",\n    \"evidence:source:f17758b91395ba7ce7339162e3a8de3e1d2e268e80f5c10e2b0af4554e46bd3c\",\n    \"evidence:source:d7a688391e28231c21325fab8db56be021368c494f904ceb04ef9db207f77735\",\n    \"evidence:source:db97597a305a74992da8b2e02ee70017186d03e065a1a1e911865d0f1031d5b8\",\n    \"evidence:source:b2266d63f39acabb1907296eea765c6e5042f59bbb814bba1a7b3c8238cb9b3d\",\n    \"evidence:source:2e8603b57f20519f04494375af65e08e6a5fb34d72223b6debf0a5439685ee52\",\n    \"evidence:source:f51011f85a2bea698ff3b96318145bf9359cf91d77a6713ac8c773748b59932c\",\n    \"evidence:source:01641c9d9065e195a70d8624d53e9e6b5e6df8a2d048009ebcdeecb49c7f6e84\",\n    \"evidence:source:fffe4ca0578e1c5423076449091396f16013918e83d85b223fbc525bd4341e39\",\n    \"evidence:source:a0ccda919261d50457b464263a4c2a8d0c5d67ffec9baf8ff110173c85f43355\",\n    \"evidence:source:c717f77783e1c554637400c26db54f1c6aa0cba6ac008e377cf200e48db8debe\"\n  ],\n  \"schema_version\": \"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"para:v2_n_9_1:framework-and-primary-objective\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"本章疗效评估的范围、终点体系及评估框架应以已确认的研究目的为锚点。疗效评估以已确认的主要目的为锚点：在经高分辨率计算机断层扫描（HRCT）或肺活检确诊的特发性肺纤维化（IPF）成人试验参与者中，评估 AD-101 100 mg 每日一次（qd）和 200 mg 每日一次（qd）对比安慰剂，至第 52 周用力肺活量（FVC）较基线绝对变化值（毫升，mL）的疗效；主要检验采用固定序列检验，先评估 AD-101 200 mg qd 对比安慰剂，达到统计学显著后再评估 AD-101 100 mg qd 对比安慰剂。主要终点直接引用已确认事实：第 52 周 FVC 较基线绝对变化值（mL）。【待补充：疗效评估框架的完整范围（包括本章涵盖的终点类别、与安全性及其他章节的边界及评估责任框架）：该项待研究团队确认后补充】\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [\n        \"evidence:source:2e8603b57f20519f04494375af65e08e6a5fb34d72223b6debf0a5439685ee52\",\n        \"evidence:source:01641c9d9065e195a70d8624d53e9e6b5e6df8a2d048009ebcdeecb49c7f6e84\"\n      ],\n      \"source_locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/6:p\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"para:v2_n_9_1:primary-endpoint-measurement-and-estimand\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"主要终点的测量口径和估计目标应项目化书写。第 52 周 FVC 较基线绝对变化值（mL）的测量方法、设备校准、重复测量次数、基线定义和派生规则应在本方案中明确。【待补充：主要终点用力肺活量测量的具体操作、肺功能设备校准、重复测量与派生规则：该项待研究团队确认后补充】【待补充：主要终点对应估计目标的目标人群、变量、伴发事件处理策略和群体汇总方式：该项待研究团队确认后补充】不得以“按研究流程表”或通用模板句替代上述项目化测量口径。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [\n        \"evidence:source:2e8603b57f20519f04494375af65e08e6a5fb34d72223b6debf0a5439685ee52\"\n      ],\n      \"source_locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/6:p\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"table:v2_n_9_1:endpoint-mapping\",\n      \"kind\": \"table\",\n      \"table\": {\n        \"table_id\": \"table:v2_n_9_1:endpoint-mapping\",\n        \"block_id\": \"table:v2_n_9_1:endpoint-mapping\",\n        \"title\": \"疗效终点与目的/估计目标映射表\",\n        \"domain\": \"objectives_endpoints\",\n        \"role\": \"body_content\",\n        \"header_row_count\": 1,\n        \"review_state\": \"ai_draft\",\n        \"version\": 0,\n        \"source_locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/6:p\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          {\n            \"column_id\": \"col:objective\",\n            \"label\": \"目的\",\n            \"order\": 0,\n            \"semantic_role\": \"objective\",\n            \"style_role\": \"header\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"column_id\": \"col:endpoint\",\n            \"label\": \"终点\",\n            \"order\": 1,\n            \"semantic_role\": \"endpoint\",\n            \"style_role\": \"header\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"column_id\": \"col:estimand\",\n            \"label\": \"估计目标\",\n            \"order\": 2,\n            \"semantic_role\": \"estimand\",\n            \"style_role\": \"header\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"row_id\": \"row:primary\",\n            \"order\": 0,\n            \